===============================================================================
1. NASA DATA AND PUBLICATIONS (separate from the code licence)
===============================================================================

1.1 NASA Physical Sciences Informatics (PSI)
    https://psi.nasa.gov/  ·  JSON backend https://psi.nasa.gov/geode-py/ws/
    24 combustion-science investigation records and their "Experimental table"
    CSVs, fetched once by pipeline/fetch-psi.mjs and normalised into
    data/generated/snapshot.json (1,870 run rows; 130 summary rows; counts are
    recomputed by the pipeline and stored in snapshot.json "counts").

    Licence: as stated by PSI on each record (field "license" in the snapshot).
      - 23 of the 24 records state CC0-1.0.
      - PSI-10 (ACME / Flame Design, DOI 10.60555/w4zy-bt45) has an EMPTY licence
        field on PSI. Its licence is "not stated"; it is attributed like the
        others and the gap is disclosed on the Sources page (Kickoff V9).
    Each investigation is cited by its PSI DOI (prefix 10.60555) on the Sources
    page and in its dossier.

    Attribution: "Data: NASA Physical Sciences Informatics (PSI)."

1.2 NASA Technical Reports Server (NTRS) and other publications
    Values that are not in PSI (Saffire IV–VI, BASS-II limit points, Olson & Ferkul
    2012 Table I, LUCI, FM2 plans, FLEX limiting-O2 values) are transcribed as
    individual numbers with a page or table citation. The documents themselves are
    cited and linked, NOT redistributed in this repository. See
    docs/submission/references.md and the in-app Sources page for the full list.

1.3 NASA marks
    This repository and the deployed site contain no NASA logos, insignia
    ("meatball"), logotype ("worm"), seal, flags or mission patches. Use of NASA
    data does not imply NASA endorsement.


