4. SUPER INTELLIGENCE (SI / AI) ACKNOWLEDGEMENT
===============================================================================

AI (SI) tools assisted the development of the source code, data-pipeline
code, tests and documentation in this repository. Each published scientific
value was checked against its primary source with AI assistance; the page or
table and a short verbatim quote are recorded so anyone can re-check it, and
the app labels the check accordingly. The deployed app makes no AI calls at
run time. The illustrations on the Guide page are AI-generated (made with
Higgsfield) and are labelled as such on screen; every chart and screenshot is
drawn from the data or captured from the app.
See README.md ("Use of SI") and docs/compliance/si-usage-log.md.
